# Vivaldi, L'inverno / Winter, Op. 8 No. 4, RV 297, first movement (Allegro non molto, F minor).
# The notes are the Mutopia Project's (examples/scores/rv297-winter.mid,
# CC BY-SA 3.0, see examples/scores/LICENSE.txt), imported as they are.
# Winter, shivering: an MS-20 lead for the solo, Pro-One and Moog strings
# for the violins, an SH-101 viola and a Minimoog under the cello chords.
tempo 140
swing 50

track solo synth Ms20 Ms20Lead
track violin1 synth ProOne ProStrings
track violin2 synth Minimoog MoogStrings
track viola synth Sh101 Sh101Strings
track cello synth Minimoog MoogStrings
strip solo: Level 0.59, Pan 0.0, Send2 0.25
strip violin1: Level 0.45, Pan -0.45, Send2 0.35
strip violin2: Level 0.42, Pan 0.45, Send2 0.35
strip viola: Level 0.45, Pan 0.2, Send2 0.35
strip cello: Level 0.61, Pan -0.2, Send2 0.35
master: MasterGain 1, P2Type Reverb, P2Return 0.35

